    "introduction": "Milo Manara has reinvented the imagery in comic strips, freeing women’s desires by means of the protagonists in his storyboards. His meeting with Hugo Pratt, a master of the genre and fellow traveler, was decisive to his own career, which explored the power of sex as a political act, culminating in the publication of Il gioco. His partnership with Federico Fellini redefined the borders between eroticism, cinema, and comics, and his unmistakable style as a draughtsman made him a model for entire generations.",
